dist/
node_modules/
scripts/.cache/
.impeccable/

# Canvas harness. These arrived when aleron-canvas-test was moved in, and this
# repo is published to GitHub Pages, so anything secret here is one `git add -A`
# from being public.
#
# OAuth client secrets for the two Canvas app registrations.
*.env
!*.env.example
# Tailscale-issued TLS material for the dev server's HTTPS.
*.key
*.crt
# Real patient uuids on a live Canvas instance, written by create-patients.
aleron-canvas-test/created-patients.json
# Probe output. Same reason: it records the patient uuid, the note keys and the
# DocumentReference ids of a live chart. The finding it produces is meant to be
# quoted into docs/canvas/INSTANCE-FINDINGS.md in Aleron-Web; the raw file is not.
aleron-canvas-test/documentreference-amendment.json
aleron-canvas-test/attribution-log.jsonl
# Dev-server output.
*.log
